WEBVTT

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:28.140
Hello? Aren't you getting on?

00:00:36.050 --> 00:00:37.990
Miyu, what's wrong?

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.950
Oh, nothing.

00:00:51.100 --> 00:00:56.370
I'm sorry. It's not your fault.
It's just...

00:00:57.270 --> 00:00:58.330
I'm tired.

00:00:58.540 --> 00:01:01.300
Tell me what part of me
you are not happy with.

00:01:02.010 --> 00:01:03.170
Excuse me!

00:01:05.650 --> 00:01:07.340
This is the last stop.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.690
AQUARIUM

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:43.910
SPECIAL ROOM

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:51.860
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:52.050 --> 00:02:56.290
...and lead them to ruin.

00:02:56.890 --> 00:03:02.300
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.700
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:06.900 --> 00:03:09.840
...in the human world.

00:03:10.240 --> 00:03:13.700
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:14.640 --> 00:03:20.340
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:26.040
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:30.170
No one knows her true face.

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.680
You don't like me anymore?

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:05.190
It's not that.
You are very nice, but...

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:11.470
...your love is too much for me,
too much for me to bear.

00:04:11.670 --> 00:04:14.160
- But I love you!
- I know.

00:04:14.370 --> 00:04:16.860
But it pains me...

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:21.310
...to have to reciprocate
your feelings all the time.

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:25.310
We should spend some time apart
for a while.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:27.140
I don't want to!

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:31.980
If you love someone, it's natural
to want to be with her.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.680
That's exactly what is burdening me!

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:46.290
What am I doing wrong?

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:58.050
What am I doing wrong?

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:15.860
They look happy, don't they?

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:18.670
You mean the fish?

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:23.890
They get to live in such a quiet place
all alone. That's nice.

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:28.230
- I think it's lonely.
- Why?

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:30.540
I wouldn't be able to stand it.

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:34.770
Waiting for someone without
knowing if or when he'll show up.

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:38.280
What makes you think
they're waiting for someone?

00:05:38.490 --> 00:05:41.790
No one can exist alone.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:46.430
Humans maybe, but that's
not true for fish.

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:52.000
They have been alone in the dark
deep sea from the ancient past...

00:05:52.200 --> 00:05:54.030
...without wishing for anything.

00:05:54.440 --> 00:05:57.500
That's not true. Come this way.

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:15.550
She is lonely.

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:20.590
So every time I come,
she happily welcomes me.

00:06:20.800 --> 00:06:23.890
It's possible that you're
the lonely one.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:25.660
It could be.

00:06:25.930 --> 00:06:28.930
But I'm happy now.

00:06:29.140 --> 00:06:33.440
There is someone here who responds
to me when I give her my love.

00:06:33.640 --> 00:06:35.230
That's why...

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:37.210
Is that so...

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:45.750
You are always here.

00:06:46.020 --> 00:06:47.010
You are?

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:51.150
I'm the director of this aquarium.

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.260
Do you like this mermaid?

00:06:53.760 --> 00:06:56.750
Yes. She is very beautiful.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.970
She is usually asleep...

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:03.260
...but she wakes up when you visit.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.240
Does she dream?

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:11.570
I really don't know. Perhaps.

00:07:12.010 --> 00:07:16.210
Why is she here?

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:19.080
It was given to me a long time ago.

00:07:19.290 --> 00:07:22.450
Mermaids are very sensitive creatures.

00:07:22.660 --> 00:07:26.720
So sensitive they might die when
exposed to many curious eyes.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:30.690
That's why I am keeping her
quietly in here.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:34.060
I usually have the door
to this room locked.

00:07:34.670 --> 00:07:40.370
Please don't tell anyone
that she is here.

00:07:41.310 --> 00:07:43.740
It is for the sake of the mermaid.

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:45.740
Of course.

00:07:46.580 --> 00:07:50.180
I knew you two would understand.

00:07:50.390 --> 00:07:53.190
Please enjoy your visit.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.060
- It will be our secret.
- Sure.

00:08:18.650 --> 00:08:22.340
Someone tried to manipulate someone...

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:27.380
...but ended up
being manipulated instead.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:30.620
Funny, isn't it, Larva?

00:08:31.190 --> 00:08:35.220
That's how humans
and Shinmas come in contact.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:40.190
Is she a human too?

00:08:41.270 --> 00:08:45.670
It's complicated! Could you
explain who is the Shinma?

00:08:46.680 --> 00:08:50.710
It's so quiet here. Nothing moves...

00:08:50.910 --> 00:08:54.780
...even though the long roots are
intertwined under the ground.

00:08:54.980 --> 00:08:58.440
What are you talking about?
I don't understand.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:03.720
Soon bamboo roots will appear,
shooting out of the ground.

00:09:12.430 --> 00:09:17.770
Tell me what kind of dreams
you are having.

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:21.700
I want to know everything about you.

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:12.020
Is this your home?

00:10:21.100 --> 00:10:23.090
I see.

00:10:23.310 --> 00:10:28.650
You just want to go home.

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:32.010
Could you see...

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.640
...the mermaid's dream?

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:37.450
She wants to go back.

00:10:37.650 --> 00:10:41.420
Probably to the tropical sea.
That's where...

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.250
Yes, that's where she was born.

00:10:44.460 --> 00:10:48.330
Send her back! I feel bad
that she is here all alone!

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:52.920
She needs bright sunshine
and the smell of the ocean!

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:54.160
I can't.

00:10:54.570 --> 00:10:57.590
Why? Because this place
is an aquarium?

00:10:57.810 --> 00:11:01.570
Is it because you want
to keep a rare creature here?

00:11:02.640 --> 00:11:06.840
Her home no longer exists.

00:11:07.050 --> 00:11:11.920
Beautiful oceans and hidden beaches
free of human contact...

00:11:12.120 --> 00:11:15.520
...just can't be found on
Earth anymore.

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:21.390
What she is dreaming about are just
memories. The paradise of illusion.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:25.900
That's not true!
I will find it for her!

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:30.330
It's time for me to lock up this room.

00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:43.650
I want you to help me.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.620
I'm returning her to the sea.

00:11:48.090 --> 00:11:49.850
I don't think you should.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:54.790
Why? All she does is dream about
returning to the sea.

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:58.720
That's your own dream.

00:11:58.930 --> 00:12:02.160
You are reflecting your thoughts
onto the mermaid.

00:12:02.600 --> 00:12:07.540
- No! I witnessed her dreams!
- That's what you want to believe.

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:12.180
How come no one understands me?
I want to do something for her!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:16.950
Are you saying that
helping someone is bad?

00:12:26.190 --> 00:12:28.460
Everyone is the same.

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:33.400
But I won't give up.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:35.690
I will never give up.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:45.470
I will take you back.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:49.240
So don't worry.

00:12:53.520 --> 00:12:57.790
Farewell to the human world.

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:37.320
Just wait a little longer
and you'll be free.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.550
Here I am.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:05.550
Here. Come to me.

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:38.430
Despite the outcome, you were happy.

00:14:39.090 --> 00:14:40.530
Larva!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:17.700
SHINMA
RIN KOH

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:21.290
Finally you reveal yourself.

00:15:29.680 --> 00:15:32.700
Stray Shinma, into the darkness!

00:15:55.740 --> 00:16:00.470
Maybe the dream itself was genuine.

00:16:02.340 --> 00:16:07.010
Are you sad? Now you've lost your
source of nourishment.

00:16:07.220 --> 00:16:08.820
You knew...

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:12.280
You are Yaobikuni, aren't you?

00:16:13.360 --> 00:16:15.030
Yes.

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:23.730
700 years ago, I ate mermaid flesh.

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.090
I was still so young...

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:30.930
...and did not understand
what it meant.

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:34.700
Whoever eats mermaid flesh
becomes immortal.

00:16:34.910 --> 00:16:38.400
I have been living for so long.

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:42.880
I've grown tired of it, and yet...

00:16:43.150 --> 00:16:46.240
...I'm still here.

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:52.560
I heard that the legendary Yaobikuni
starved herself to death...

00:16:53.030 --> 00:16:55.260
...after becoming bored of living.

00:16:56.560 --> 00:16:58.720
But you did not die.

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:04.430
I'm scared. The legend was wrong.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:09.580
I grew older and older
until I became what I am.

00:17:09.810 --> 00:17:13.210
I will probably die
in a hundred years.

00:17:13.420 --> 00:17:16.590
The thought of it frightens me.

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:21.350
That's why you were
keeping the mermaid.

00:17:21.560 --> 00:17:26.520
So that you could live longer.
Capturing humans as bait.

00:17:26.730 --> 00:17:32.220
Correct. We captured young men
like him before.

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:37.290
I don't know if the mermaid shows
that kind of dream to humans...

00:17:37.510 --> 00:17:42.540
...because she wants to eat them,
or if that is her genuine dream.

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:47.810
There will always be a lost young man
attracted to her dreams...

00:17:48.020 --> 00:17:51.510
...who will try to rescue her...

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:54.650
...and will get eaten.

00:17:55.220 --> 00:17:58.620
That's how she has survived.

00:17:58.830 --> 00:18:02.020
It never scared me before.

00:18:02.230 --> 00:18:06.600
I have seen many human deaths.

00:18:09.600 --> 00:18:12.540
Do you want to survive
at such a cost?

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:15.830
I thought you were tired of it.

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:17.410
I am so confused.

00:18:17.610 --> 00:18:22.950
No matter how hard I think about it...

00:18:23.150 --> 00:18:26.120
...I don't know what I'm living for...

00:18:26.320 --> 00:18:28.910
...or if my true wish is to die.

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.920
I'm just afraid to face the moment.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:35.490
The decisive moment of my destiny.

00:18:35.700 --> 00:18:38.600
So you have wasted 700 years
of your life.

00:18:38.800 --> 00:18:40.290
Please wait!

00:18:41.200 --> 00:18:43.530
I have heard about you!

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:47.570
I heard you provide eternal dreams.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:50.450
Happy dreams.

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:54.180
Could you please give me one?

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:57.010
Please have pity on me.

00:18:57.620 --> 00:18:59.550
I refuse.

00:19:00.690 --> 00:19:04.320
Is it because
I helped destroy a human life?

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.620
That's not my main concern.

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.530
You chose the destiny of immortality.

00:19:12.870 --> 00:19:16.200
Humans bear the destiny
of eventually dying.

00:19:16.400 --> 00:19:20.130
That's why they suffer and grieve.

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:24.780
But in return,
they can also find true happiness.

00:19:25.380 --> 00:19:30.110
Is it selfish to want happiness
without facing your own mortality?

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:35.250
You will die in another 100 years.

00:19:35.460 --> 00:19:39.290
Why don't you experience
human suffering...

00:19:39.490 --> 00:19:41.590
...until your last day.

00:19:41.800 --> 00:19:44.890
That's your destiny.

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:58.010
What a disgusting human,
trying to prolong her life...

00:19:58.210 --> 00:20:00.840
...by taking advantage of a Shinma!

00:20:01.050 --> 00:20:03.520
I wonder which one
was being manipulated.

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:09.710
That old lady has lived this long
being manipulated by the Shinma.

00:20:10.430 --> 00:20:16.500
Right. No one can escape from
the destiny which he himself chose.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:19.290
Even if you didn't choose.

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:23.670
Miyu, is it too hard for you?

00:20:24.340 --> 00:20:29.570
I just keep on living
my destiny because...

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:33.650
...I'm not human.

00:21:03.040 --> 00:21:05.530
Are you waiting for someone?

00:21:08.380 --> 00:21:09.540
Yes.

00:21:10.220 --> 00:21:14.520
Someone very dear to me.

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:19.280
I said something very mean to him.

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:24.130
I've been thinking about him a lot.

00:21:24.330 --> 00:21:27.860
I want to apologize to him
and start over with him.

00:21:28.070 --> 00:21:32.100
I don't think he is going
to come here anymore.

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:35.370
But he is happy now.

00:21:35.580 --> 00:21:38.370
Hey, Miyu. What are you doing?

00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:40.480
Wait up!

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:18.880
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:19.090 --> 00:22:21.420
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:21.620 --> 00:22:25.560
...from so far away?

00:22:25.760 --> 00:22:28.390
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:22:28.600 --> 00:22:32.660
Who are you?

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:39.330
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:39.540 --> 00:22:44.170
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:44.380 --> 00:22:48.640
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:48.850 --> 00:22:53.120
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:57.310
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:57.530 --> 00:23:01.800
Washed away

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:08.590
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:08.800 --> 00:23:13.030
Invited by the moon

00:23:13.240 --> 00:23:16.970
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:19.610 --> 00:23:26.140
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:26.390 --> 00:23:33.320
The sky cries for me

00:23:40.500 --> 00:23:46.530
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:46.740 --> 00:23:49.070
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:49.280 --> 00:23:53.210
...from so far away?

00:23:53.410 --> 00:23:56.040
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:23:56.250 --> 00:24:00.310
Who are you?

00:24:02.990 --> 00:24:06.980
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:07.200 --> 00:24:11.830
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:12.030 --> 00:24:16.300
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:24:16.500 --> 00:24:20.770
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:20.980 --> 00:24:24.980
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:29.440
Washed away

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:36.250
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:36.460 --> 00:24:40.690
Invited by the moon

00:24:40.900 --> 00:24:44.640
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:47.270 --> 00:24:53.800
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:54.040 --> 00:25:00.970
The sky cries for me

00:25:06.620 --> 00:25:10.450
Yui-Li is a priestess
trying to capture a Shinma.

00:25:10.660 --> 00:25:16.650
But anger clouded her eyes,
and she fell into the Shinma's trap.

00:25:16.860 --> 00:25:20.130
I will rescue you
in exchange for blood.

00:25:20.330 --> 00:25:25.360
I don't want my playground messed up
by a Shinma from a foreign land.

00:25:25.710 --> 00:25:29.940
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Woman Priestess."

00:25:30.140 --> 00:25:33.940
Yui-Li, you are fortunate!
